{{PCExclusive}}
'''New Year Momo''' is an [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that is exclusive to the collaboration [[Minna de Nyanko Daisensou/PostPet Collaboration Event|Post Pet Momo's Optical Line Pioneering Story! Salesman Nyanmaru Tour]], only available in the [[Minna de Nyanko Daisensou|PC version]], from 29th December 2017 to 9th January 2018.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 905
|rarity = EX
|version = PC
|name1 = New Year Momo
|name2 = New Year Momo & Cat
|image1 = 10905 1.PNG
|image2 = 10905 2.PNG
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''New Year Momo & Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Similarly to [[Momo (PC Special Cat)|Momo]], its non-new years variant, this unit has very little usage due to its poor DPS and most importantly, Single Target. Even though it has above-average range, [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] has more range and overall better stats. However, it does have the Money Up ability, which could give it some use against weak peons like [[Doge]] and [[Snache]].

